    <data key="d0">Spot.io Automated Spot Instance Management SaaS Platform</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Spot.io predicts spot instance interruptions using SageMaker ML models on Aurora data, using cross-account IAM roles to replace client worker nodes in EKS.</data>
